    "detailed_description": "This mini game was made possible with Godot Engine:<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2017790/extras/5ee167320f751301ed0b92428a1cbb52.avif?t=1689520536\" /></div><br><br>This game is a:<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2017790/extras/b1bddc025304f2a758eb7fd41ae61e81.avif?t=1689520536\" /></div><br>This game very miniature experience made by a solo indie game developer Miles Thatch (TheConceptBoy). It's entire gameplay is you being confined to one room and a few enemy spawners and couple of weapons. It is priced aggressively to deter random people from mistaking it for a complete experience, only to then realize it's a mini game and complain about lack of content. Do not buy it unless you are familiar with the developer and are explicitly making a decision to support them and their development endevours.<br><br>Welcome to Machine Phantasm. A tiny VR Arena Shooter. A mini game in a box, literally. Test how long can you make it against waves of primitive enemies.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2017790/extras/37c2c44f7058362d4aae91deab6946ab.avif?t=1689520536\" /></div><br><br>Current Features<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>3x Weapons<br></li><li>2x Wrist Mounted Shotguns<br></li><li>4x Holstering Zones<br></li><li>2x Auto-deploy Magazines<br></li><li>3x Enemy Types<br></li><li>Ammo &amp; Heath Shop</li></ul><br><br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2017790/extras/9c2b13dec619fa6e6147dce7f4dede8e.avif?t=1689520536\" /></div><br><br>Content:<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Waves Game Mode<br></li><li>10 Action Soundtracks</li></ul>",
